│BULK CLEANUP                                                                                  │
│──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
││ Bulk Cleanup Operations                                      Actions                        │
││                                                              ───────────────────────────────│
││   [✓] Delete completed tasks (>30 days) (~10 tasks)           j/k navigate                  │
││   [ ] Archive all done tasks (~25 tasks)                      Space toggle                  │
││ ▶ [✓] Remove orphaned worktrees (~5 worktrees)                a select all                  │
││    Delete worktrees with no active sessions                   A deselect all                │
││   [ ] Clean stale sessions (~2 sessions)                      Enter execute                 │
││                                                               Esc cancel                    │
